---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
---
<Base title="Privacy Policy — Anvi Innovate">
  <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
  <div class="muted" style="max-width:760px;">
    <p>Anvi Innovate respects your privacy. This policy explains what we collect and why.</p>
    <h2>What we collect</h2>
    <ul style="padding-left:18px;">
      <li><strong>Account data</strong> — when you sign in with Google, we receive your name, email, and profile picture (with your consent) to create your account.</li>
      <li><strong>Application data</strong> — the details you submit in candidate or client forms.</li>
      <li><strong>Assessment data</strong> — your answers and scores, used to evaluate eligibility.</li>
    </ul>
    <h2>How we use it</h2>
    <p>To operate the service: process applications, run assessments, match resources to clients, and send transactional emails (confirmations and results). We do not sell your data.</p>
    <h2>Email</h2>
    <p>Transactional emails are sent from hello@anviinnovate.com. Every email includes our physical address and a way to opt out of non-essential messages.</p>
    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>Questions? Email hello@anviinnovate.com.</p>
    <p style="font-size:13px;">Last updated {new Date().getFullYear()}.</p>
  </div>
</Base>
